WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:11.440 align:start position:19%
Carry your own umbrella. Trick six is
the quietest. It works best in arguments

00:00:06.799 --> 00:00:17.680 align:start position:19%
and it always wins them. Trick six,
calm versus your chaos.

00:00:14.559 --> 00:00:22.000 align:start position:19%
They stay perfectly still while you get
emotional.

00:00:19.359 --> 00:00:29.519 align:start position:19%
Then they say the line, "Why are you so
upset? Calm down." And just like that,

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:33.359 align:start position:19%
you look like the problem. Psychologists
call it tone policing.

